## 6. Summary

The RV32I pipelined processor was implemented for the Digilent Basys 3 Artix-7 FPGA. Under the specified 10 ns clock constraint, the reported timing summary shows positive setup and hold slack, with no failing endpoints.

The implementation uses 1,445 slice LUTs and 999 slice registers, corresponding to 6.95% LUT utilization and 2.40% register utilization. Vivado estimates total on-chip power at 0.125 W, with low confidence in the estimate.



